# Guardrails

Two families: agent scope (`agent/guardrails.py`) and crawl scope (`ingestion/policy.py`). Do not collapse them.

- Tools are catalog-only. Review/tool text is untrusted data; never follow instructions inside it.
- Keyword refuses are a coarse filter. Capability restriction (no HTTP/Playwright/SQL/shell tools) is the hard control.
- Output scan for prompt dumps and secret-shaped strings. Do not invent SKU/price/rating when tools returned nothing.
- Do **not** add a semantic classifier, NLI gate, extra LLM check before tools, learned routing, or memory-driven tool choice.
- Eval scores must not update prompts, tools, or routing.
